{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20877","headline":"黄头郎 · 李贺","name":"黄头郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄头郎，捞拢去不归。\n南浦芙蓉影，愁红独自垂。\n水弄湘娥佩，竹啼山露月。\n玉瑟调青门，石云湿黄葛。\n沙上蘼芜花，秋风已先发。\n好持扫罗荐，香出鸳鸯热。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}